你确定米奇尔不建议我跟着去吗
You sure Mitchell won't mind me tagging along?

167
00:06:54,597 --> 00:06:56,280
开什么玩笑 他很爱你的
Are you kidding? He loves ya.

168
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,200
你在担心什么
What are you worried about?

169
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,620
我以前从来没有过兄弟
I've never had a brother before.

170
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:01,720
我和他一起相处的时间也不多
We never really hung out that much.

171
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,897
孩子 你想太多了
Kiddo, you are overthinking this.

172
00:07:03,897 --> 00:07:05,920
我只是不想说错话
I just don't wanna say the wrong thing.

173
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,940
不会的 那正是有兄弟的好处
You can't. That's the beauty of having a brother.

174
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,300
我和我弟弟总是相互抨击
Me and my brother were zinging each other all the time.

175
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:12,980
比如 "什么情况啊 肥仔"
You know, like, "What's going on, fat boy?"

176
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:14,260
"没什么 蠢蛋'
"Nothing much, jackass."

177
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:15,600
就像那样互相出糗
You know, things of that nature.

178
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:19,156
那是兄弟间表达爱的方式
It's- It's how brothers express love.

179
00:07:23,388 --> 00:07:25,141
副驾驶位已占 衰仔
Shotgun, sucka!

180
00:07:26,735 --> 00:07:29,125
哈哈 真有你的
Yeah. That's good.

181
00:07:29,185 --> 00:07:31,904
我去欣赏一下风景
I'm gonna see the sights.

182
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:34,460
别让风景先看到你哦
Not if they see you first!

183
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:37,020
刚刚那玩笑没有笑点 孩子
Kind of missed with that one, kid.

184
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,000
好了
All right.

185
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:43,620
你想知道的信息都在上面
This is all you need to know right here.

186
00:07:44,633 --> 00:07:46,205
显然 铅笔杆一开始是分开的
Apparently, the pencil's in two pieces,

187
00:07:46,205 --> 00:07:47,799
然后才将铅锌放中间粘合到一起
and they glue 'em together on the lead.

188
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:50,540
我们把关于他生平的材料放这边
What if we put all the stuff about his life on this side...

189
00:07:50,540 --> 00:07:53,120
关于他画作的材料放那边怎么样
and all the stuff about his paintings on this side?

190
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:55,520
卢克 小老弟 那太棒了
Luke, buddy, that's fantastic!

191
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:57,660
最棒的是 这个主意是你自己想出来的
And the best part is, you came up with that by yourself.

192
00:07:58,619 --> 00:08:01,952
只需要一点专注就做到了
All it took was a little bit of focus and, uh-

193
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:03,460
这玩意儿真松了
This thing is really loose.

194
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:06,600
我去拿把螺丝起子 你继续弄这个
I'm gonna go grab a screwdriver. But you run with this.

195
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:09,137
各就各位 预备开始 小梵高
On your mark, get set, Van Gogh.

196
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:12,202
嘿 爸 他长得有点像米奇尔舅舅
Hey, Dad. He kind of looks like Uncle Mitchell,

197
00:08:12,202 --> 00:08:14,153
如果米奇尔舅舅是疯子的话
if Uncle Mitchell were insane.

198
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:19,280
我被黄鼠狼的臭液喷到了
I got sprayed by a skunk!

199
00:08:21,015 --> 00:08:22,189
你臭死了
Oh, you stink!

200
00:08:22,189 --> 00:08:25,057
不仅是在天文学方面很"臭" 攻击成功
And not just at astronomy! Blammo!

201
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,940
是怎么回事啊
What is happening?

202
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:34,940
我爱这地方
I love this place.

203
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:37,480
我有点担心 因为这并不是...
I was a little bit worried because it's not exactly-

204
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:40,160
我 爱 这地方
I... love... this place.

205
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,980
我 很 紧张
I... was... nervous.

206
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:45,480
我是说 菜单上有很多不同的食物
I mean, there was a lot of different food on the menu,

207
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:48,140
地上也有 墙上也有
and on the floor, and on the wall.

208
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,820
你确定你的话没有任何一点夸张吗
Are we sure we're not exaggerating just a little bit?

209
00:08:50,900 --> 00:08:51,620
你当时在现场吗 米奇
Were you there, Mitchell?

210
00:08:51,820 --> 00:08:52,980
如果你在 我肯定能认得出当场
Because I think I would have recognized

211
00:08:52,980 --> 00:08:54,440
除我之外的唯一一个白人或同志
the only other white or gay person.

212
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,397
我已经冒犯过歌洛莉亚一次了
I'd already offended Gloria once.

213
00:08:57,397 --> 00:08:59,295
不能再有第二次了
Not gonna do it again.

214
00:09:05,334 --> 00:09:07,600
-那是我朋友卡梅隆 -欢迎光临
- Mi amigo Cameron. - Ah, welcome.

215
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,280
-照旧点"辣得跳"吧 -你还记得啊
- So, carnitas diablos. - Ah, you remember.

216
00:09:10,156 --> 00:09:12,520
也给我同样的吧
Um, I'll just have the same thing.

217
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:14,440
不不不 你该点鸡肉玉米卷
No, no, no. You should have the chicken enchiladas.

218
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:17,720
不 我也要"辣得跳"
No, I'll have the carnitas diablos.

219
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:19,780
-你扛不住的 -你说什么
- These are not for you. - Excuse me?

220
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:20,979
那东西太辣了
They're too spicy.

221
00:09:20,979 --> 00:09:22,020
歌洛莉亚小姐是因为已经习惯了
Miss Gloria's used to it.

222
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:22,900
他说的对
Yeah, he's right.

223
00:09:23,220 --> 00:09:26,980
我可以辣得让你震惊到趴下 美女
I can spice you under the table any day there, sweet thing.

224
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:30,780
就要"辣得跳" 谢谢
Dos carnitas diablos, por favor.

225
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:32,640
好吧
Okay.

226
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:33,260
好吧
Okay.

227
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,460
-米奇 止步 -好吧 我妄想什么呢
- Mitchell! - Of course. What was I thinking?

228
00:09:39,541 --> 00:09:42,945
爸 我们 能直接回家了吗
Dad, can we- can we just go home, please?

229
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:45,660
你得先把身上臭气散掉 我才让你进车
You've got to air out first before I let you in that car.

230
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,420
否则车里的气味永远消不掉
I'll never get the stink out.

231
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,340
嘿 杰 那是金星吗
Hey, Jay, is that Venus?

232
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:52,480
我从这儿可以闻到纯硫酸的酸臭气哦
'Cause I can smell the clouds of pure sulfuric acid from here.

233
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:56,080
-躺枪 -好吧 我真得回家了
- Slam! - Okay. I-I'd really like to go home now.

234
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,540
我们会错过流星雨的
We'll miss the meteor shower.

235
00:09:57,700 --> 00:09:58,800
问题出在你的衣服上
The trouble is your clothes.

236
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:01,940
脱下吧 车后备箱里有条毛毯
Just take them off. I think there's a blanket in the trunk.

237
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,660
你确定吗 老爸
You sure, Dad?

238
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:04,320
你不担心我会把毛毯弄臭吗
You're not worried I might stink up the blanket?

239
00:10:04,460 --> 00:10:05,520
别担心
Don't worry about it.

240
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:07,500
那是我们用来铺在车座上的
We just use it to cover up the seat

241
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:09,840
曼尼练完探戈会汗淋淋的要隔一下
for when Manny's all sweaty after his tango class.

242
00:10:10,060 --> 00:10:12,060
如果你没出汗 就说明你练得不对
If you don't sweat, you're not doing it right.

243
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,840
他是我曾拥有的最佳男友之一
He was one of the best boyfriends I ever had.

244
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,900
-但他是同性恋 -是啊
- But he was gay. - Yeah.

245
00:10:23,900 --> 00:10:25,739
我第一个月后就察觉出来了
I figured that out after the first month-

246
00:10:25,739 --> 00:10:26,960
但我跟他继续谈了一年
And I stayed for a whole year

247
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,800
因为他剪的发型超赞
because the haircuts were fantastic!

248
00:10:30,010 --> 00:10:31,150
很好笑吧
It's funny, huh?

249
00:10:33,254 --> 00:10:34,759
卡梅隆 也没那么好笑吧
Cameron, that one is not that funny.

250
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,061
-你没事吧 -我没事
- Are you okay? - I'm fine.

251
00:10:36,437 --> 00:10:38,786
-你确定吗 -我喜欢这地方
- Are you sure? - I love this place.

252
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:41,340
但你头上汗如雨下
But your head is running water.

253
00:10:41,420 --> 00:10:42,460
不 你大概看错了
No, I don't think it is.

254
00:10:43,220 --> 00:10:46,035
我就说对你太辣了吧 你的衬衫都汗湿了
I told you it was too spicy for you. Look at your shirt.

255
00:10:46,035 --> 00:10:49,280
-我得去喝点东西缓解一下 -不不
- I just need to get a bit of a drink of something. - No, no, no!

256
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:51,840
卡梅隆 喝水只会辣上加辣 不要
Cameron, the water makes it so worse. No!

257
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:54,940
你说的对 真是辣上加辣了
Oh, you're right. That does make it worse.

258
00:10:55,415 --> 00:10:57,511
我感觉就像是吞下了火辣的太阳
Oh- I feel like I ate the sun!

259
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:01,420
那就是面粉不搅成块状物的秘诀
And that is the secret to no lumps.

260
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,597
瞧见了吗 挺有趣的
See? It's kind of fun.

261
00:11:02,597 --> 00:11:04,344
-都是你的功劳 妈 -嗯
- You make it fun, Mom. - Mmm.

262
00:11:04,344 --> 00:11:06,588
听听"注意力缺陷过动症"的症状
Listen to these symptoms of A.D.H.D.

263
00:11:06,588 --> 00:11:08,680
-你们敢说卢克不符合吗 -艾丽克斯
- And tell me it's not Luke. - Alex!

264
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:11,500
极易因外界无关刺激而分心
"Easily distracted by irrelevant stimuli."

265
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:24,720
经常冲动地放弃正在干的事 去干别的事
"Often impulsively abandons one task for another."

266
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:33,500
原来我是放在那里了啊
That's where I left those.

267
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:36,940
在行动前不考虑后果
"A tendency to act without regard to consequences,

268
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:40,220
经常不考虑个人安全
often at the expense of personal safety."

269
00:11:57,718 --> 00:11:59,240
-经常发生事故 -好了 别读了
- "Having accidents more often" -Ok, you know what?

270
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:02,780
够了 艾丽克斯 我们懂了
I think that's enough, Alex. We've got it.

271
00:12:14,413 --> 00:12:16,853
噢 不 不
Oh, no. No!

272
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:25,520
菲尔 菲尔 亲爱的 你没事吧
Phil. Phil! Honey, are you okay?

273
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:28,540
没事 记得之前找不到的那个太阳镜吗
Yeah. Remember those sunglasses I couldn't find?

274
00:12:29,420 --> 00:12:29,840
找到啦
Bingo!

275
00:12:31,660 --> 00:12:34,640
我就让你做一件事 就是监督卢克
I asked you to do one thing- stay on top of Luke.

276
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:35,278
我想告诉你
For your information,

277
00:12:35,278 --> 00:12:37,576
你儿子正努力地解读一副梵高的...
your son is hard at work on an awesome Van Gogh-

278
00:12:37,648 --> 00:12:39,125
得修下楼梯了 杰作
Gotta fix that- masterpiece.

279
00:12:39,125 --> 00:12:42,029
你看了就知道了 你会大吃一惊的
Wait'll you see. You're gonna be so surprised.

280
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:42,640
老天 亲爱的
Oh, God, honey.

281
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:45,180
我就等着他能令我大吃一惊呢 真的
I want nothing more than to be surprised, really.

282
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,080
我一点都不惊讶
I'm not surprised.

283
00:12:55,180 --> 00:12:56,800
好了 够了 我再也不想听
Okay, that's it. I don't want to hear anything

284
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,800
你所谓的做事的新方法
about your new method of doing things.

285
00:12:58,800 --> 00:13:00,420
对付那些孩子只有一个方法
There's one thing that works with these kids,

286
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:02,360
就是严格监督 严厉管教
and that is staying on top of them,

287
00:13:02,380 --> 00:13:03,980
多亏了你 我的朋友
which, thanks to you, my friend,

288
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:06,140
我得忙活一整晚了
I will now be able to do all night long.

289
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:15,180
我很不高兴 老弟
Not happy, dude.

290
00:13:15,260 --> 00:13:16,300
你该在干正经事才对
You're supposed to be working.

291
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,420
我在干正经事啊
I am working.

292
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:18,793
玩土豆娃娃 正经个屁啊
Mr. Potato Head, really?

293
00:13:18,793 --> 00:13:21,160
-我知道你怎么想的 -不 我不想听
- I know what you think, but- - No, I don't wanna hear it.

294
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,360
我要下去清扫车库
I'm going down to clean up the garage,

295
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:24,120
然后我会回来 一直监督着你
then I'm coming back and I'm gonna stand over you

296
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,580
直到你最终完成 明白吗
until this thing is done, okay?

297
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,560
-快吸气 -吸气只会让"火"烧得更旺
- Breathe. - Breathing only makes the fire spread.

298
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:36,440
好吧 那就喝了这瓶牛奶
Okay. Then drink this milk.

299
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:41,040
小卡 你为什么要点那道辣菜
Ay, Cam. Why did you have to order that spicy dish?

300
00:13:41,102 --> 00:13:42,998
因为 我 我是个大白痴
Because I'm, um, a big idiot...

301
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:47,280
我希望你我二人能度过一个美好的夜晚
and I wanted to have this awesome night between the two of us...

302
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:49,039
然后我们变成好闺蜜
where we end up best friends,

303
00:13:49,039 --> 00:13:52,016
一起出去吃饭 买鞋
uh, having lunch, buying shoes.

304
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:55,020
好啊 我们一起去吃饭 买鞋吧
Okay! Let's go have lunch, let's go buy shoes.

305
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:58,780
-真的吗 -是啊 你为什么这么惊讶
- Really? - Yeah. Why are you so surprised?

306
00:13:58,780 --> 00:14:00,920
我不知道 我总觉得
Well, I don't know. I guess i just always

307
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,800
我把我们之间的关系搞砸了 歌洛莉亚
feel like I blow it with you, Gloria

308
00:14:02,854 --> 00:14:04,806
不管是针对哥伦比亚的那些话
whether it's the Columbian comment...

309
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:07,060
还是选错了餐馆
or picking the wrong restaurant.

310
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:10,400
餐馆那事可不是你的错
The restaurant had nothing to do with you.

311
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:14,120
我只是没心情去那么高级的地方
I was just not in the mood to go anywhere that fancy...

312
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,840
因为我今早干了一件蠢事
after the stupid thing I did this morning.

313
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:18,240
你干什么了
What did you do?

314
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:22,780
-我买了件裙子 -你个女魔头
- I bought a dress. - You monster.

315
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:25,760
那是件超贵的裙子 其实我根本就不需要
Ay. It was a very expensive dress that I don't need.

316
00:14:25,825 --> 00:14:28,284
我回到家的时候觉得自己好愚蠢
I felt so stupid that when I got home,

317
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:30,340
我都不想把它拿回家
I couldn't even bring it inside the house.

318
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:32,980
-我放在车里了 -我完全理解
- I left it in the car. - I totally get it.

319
00:14:32,980 --> 00:14:34,360
我也有个传奇性的"帽子故事"
I have a legendary hat story.

320
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:36,260
我敢打赌你穿那件裙子一定美若天仙
I'll bet you look fabulous in that dress.

321
00:14:36,620 --> 00:14:39,880
是啊 但谁穿上那件裙子都会美若天仙的
Yes, but anyone would look fabulous in that dress.

322
00:14:40,700 --> 00:14:42,800
-你找到毛毯了吗 -没有
- You find that blanket? - No.

323
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,520
我只能找到这件裙子 快闭嘴
This was all I could find. Shut up!

324
00:14:46,575 --> 00:14:48,444
-真是完美展现你的好身材啊 -好吧
- Really shows off your shape. - Okay.

325
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:50,720
转一圈 小美妞 让我们瞧瞧你的美臀
Spin around, cupcake. Let's see the caboose!

326
00:14:50,982 --> 00:14:53,570
有没有薯条配你那"奶臀"啊
You get fries with that shake?

327
00:14:55,782 --> 00:14:56,820
我是不是太过分了
Was that too far?

328
00:14:56,820 --> 00:14:58,280
凡事都有界限的 杰
There's a line, Jay.

329
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,940
我最好过去解释一下
I better go mop this up.

330
00:15:02,268 --> 00:15:04,688
噢 拜托 怎么找不到
Oh, come on. Where's the-

331
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:10,360
如果刚刚有点过分 我向你道歉
I'm sorry if things got a little out of hand back there,

332
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:13,000
但我们想辩解一下 瞧瞧你
but in our defense, look at you.

333
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:14,600
我是说 闻闻你身上的味儿
I mean, smell you.

334
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:17,580
你的道歉可真令人"顺心"
This is a fantastic apology.

335
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:20,560
别生那孩子的气 是我教他那么做的
Oh, don't be too hard on the kid. I was egging him on.

336
00:15:22,018 --> 00:15:24,340
如果你要生气 就生我的气好啦
You're gonna be mad, be mad at me.

337
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:24,840
行啊
Done!

338
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,720
我只是很高兴看到那孩子露出笑脸
I was just happy to see him laugh a little bit.

339
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:29,140
他这周过得挺不开心的
You know, he's had kind of a tough week.

340
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:31,180
我被黄鼠狼喷了一身臭屁
I got sprayed by a skunk,

341
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,560
还穿着一条把我屁股衬托得很翘的裙子
and I'm wearing a dress that makes my hips look huge.

342
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:36,220
我知道他不希望我提起这事儿
I know he doesn't want me to talk about it,

343
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:39,380
但他没有获邀参加某个盛大的派对
but he didn't get invited to this big party.

344
00:15:40,300 --> 00:15:41,920
他自以为那些人是他的朋友
Some kids he thought were his friends

345
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:42,740
但对方认为他是个怪人
think he's weird.

346
00:15:44,267 --> 00:15:47,357
你了解我的 我 我不擅长处理这种事
Now, you know me on this. I'm no- I'm no good at it.

347
00:15:47,473 --> 00:15:49,980
我 总是不知道该如何安慰
You know, I- I never know what to say.

348
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:50,840
那倒是真的
That's true.

349
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:53,980
但或许我养大的儿子知道该怎么安慰
But maybe I raised a kid who would know what to say.

350
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:58,160
所以我才邀他一起过来
That's the only reason I invited him along-

351
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,750
因为 这种天文观测
you know, because this astronomy stuff,

352
00:15:59,750 --> 00:16:02,025
是 属于我们父子俩的亲密时刻
that's- that's our thing.

353
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,140
是啊 好吧 我去找他谈谈
Yeah. No, I'll talk to him.

354
00:16:07,020 --> 00:16:08,460
其实 你穿这件衣服一点都不可笑
You know, you don't look that ridiculous.

355
00:16:08,460 --> 00:16:11,240
-你的美腿真的可以衬起这件衣服 -老爸
- Now, you actually got the legs for it. - Dad.

356
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:11,955
不 我只是想说
No, I'm just saying,

357
00:16:11,955 --> 00:16:13,931
-如果你是那种喜欢穿女装的同性恋 -老爸
- if you were that type of a gay- - Dad!

358
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,900
可能也会混得不错哦
You'd probably do all right for yourself.

359
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:17,040
拜托
Come on!

360
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:22,180
我其实一直觉得这片地区很危险
You know, I always had a sense it was dangerous down here,

361
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:24,920
但其实还挺有魅力的 不是吗
but I guess it's actually kind of charming, isn't it?

362
00:16:25,019 --> 00:16:27,109
不 一点都不安全
No, it's not safe at all.

363
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:30,540
-我曾经就住这儿 你知道吗 -什么
- I used to live down here, you know. - What?

364
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,320
是的哦 所以我才过来 瞧那边
Yeah, that's why I come down here. Look there.

365
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,260
那是我曾经住过的公寓
That was my old apartment.

366
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:38,520
我离开哈维尔后 只能负担得起那样的房子
After I left Javier, that's all I could afford.

367
00:16:39,060 --> 00:16:40,220
那也是我人生经历的一部分
It's still part of me.

368
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:42,660
你得记住那些过往的事情
You have to remember those things,

369
00:16:42,860 --> 00:16:44,520
就像你出身在农场一样
like you when you go to your farm.

370
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:46,960
你记得那个呀 我好像是一年前告诉你的
You remember that? I told you that a year ago.

371
00:16:47,220 --> 00:16:50,160
我当然记得 你是我的朋友 你个大白痴
Of course I do. You're my friend, you big idiot.

372
00:16:51,300 --> 00:16:54,200
其实 这一地区治安或许很差劲
You know, this part of town might be very rough,

373
00:16:54,272 --> 00:16:57,218
但这里的人 小卡 他们都是最好的
but the people here, Cameron- the best.

374
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:01,220
我很确定我停车的时候 轮子还在的
I'm pretty sure I had wheels when I parked here.

375
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:03,256
奶奶个熊 谁干的
Ayayay! Who did this?

376
00:17:03,366 --> 00:17:06,260
-不 没事的 歌洛莉亚 -是谁干的
- No, it's okay, Gloria. - Who did this?

377
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:08,138
你个狗娘养的缩头乌龟
You coward son of bitches!

378
00:17:08,138 --> 00:17:10,511
没事的 大家伙 我上了保险的
It's okay, everybody! I'm- I'm insured!

379
00:17:10,573 --> 00:17:13,080
怎么 怎么着 怕了吗
What? What? You scared?

380
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:15,000
不敢出来露脸了吗 怂货娘们儿
You scared to show your face, little girl?

381
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:17,340
-不 没事的大家 -小卡 去车里待着
- No, it's all right, everybody! - Cameron, wait in the car!

382
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:19,463
-卡梅隆 -歌洛莉亚 我觉得还是可以开的
- Cameron! - Gloria, I think it's drivable.

383
00:17:20,959 --> 00:17:21,900
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

384
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:25,740
我想说 我马上会回到卢克的房间
Just so you know, I'm going back up to Luke's room,

385
00:17:25,740 --> 00:17:27,780
-他不弄完我就不走 -谢谢了
- and I'm not leaving until he's finished. - Thank you.

386
00:17:28,540 --> 00:17:31,300
我很抱歉还是有点高估卢克了
And I'm really sorry for not underestimating Luke enough.

387
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:33,060
这话让我深感宽慰
Well, that means a lot to me.

388
00:17:34,060 --> 00:17:36,260
最艰难的是 他这些毛病都是跟我学的
The hardest part is, he kinda takes after me with all this.

389
00:17:37,460 --> 00:17:38,900
比如我做事缺乏专注以及你的...
Like my lack of focus and your-

390
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:40,240
-我的什么 -我好爱你
- My what? - I just love you.

391
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,220
我完成了
I did it.

392
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:48,960
噢 老天啊
Oh, my God.

393
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,180
你们喜欢吗
Do you like it?

394
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:53,400
我 我超爱的
I-I- I love it.

395
00:17:53,695 --> 00:17:55,680
-是你帮忙的吗 -都是他一手做的
- Did you do this? -All him.

396
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,520
我用上了土豆娃娃的耳朵
I used Mr. Potato Head ears

397
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:59,220
因为梵高曾自割耳朵
because Van Gogh cut his ear off.

398
00:17:59,220 --> 00:18:00,160
上面还贴着钱
And there's money

399
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:02,900
因为他的画现在卖到天文数字般的价格
because his paintings sell for, like, a bajillion dollars,

400
00:18:02,900 --> 00:18:05,060
那很可悲 因为他死时身无分文
which is sad because he died broke.

401
00:18:05,132 --> 00:18:07,715
是啊 那...
Yes. That-

402
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,460
-你是对的 -不用道歉
- You were right. -Don't apologize.

403
00:18:10,540 --> 00:18:12,400
-我不是在道歉 -接受你的道歉了
- I'm not apologizing. -Apology accepted.

404
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:16,500
卢克 我真的好为你骄傲
Luke, I-I really couldn't be more proud of you,

405
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:18,540
我很抱歉之前看扁你了
and I am so sorry I didn't give you more credit.

406
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:20,680
-谢谢 -真棒 老弟
- Thanks. - Way to go, buddy.

407
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:24,160
得去把纸杯蛋糕做完
Gotta go finish the cupcakes.

408
00:18:24,904 --> 00:18:27,668
不 她不是吧
No. She didn't.

409
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:30,200
-亲爱的 把那个递给我好吗 -嗯哼
- Sweetie, can you hand me those? - Uh-huh.

410
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:31,720
是啊 我可以聊的
Yeah, I can talk.

411
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:34,580
你在干什么啊
What are you doing?

412
00:18:34,649 --> 00:18:36,420
我已经向你演示怎么做了
I showed you how to make 'em,

413
00:18:36,420 --> 00:18:38,220
现在你可以自己做了
and now you can do it yourself.

414
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:40,900
好了大家 都出去吧
Come on, guys. Let's go.

415
00:18:42,180 --> 00:18:45,040
很好 因为我真的很想亲自动手呢
Well, good, because I really wanted to.

416
00:18:45,593 --> 00:18:49,065
好吧 我把烤箱温度调到700度
Okay. I'm setting the oven to 700!

417
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:52,360
我 接下来把鸡蛋打入碗里
I'm putting, uh- I'm putting the eggs in the bowl!

418
00:18:52,433 --> 00:18:55,117
噢 我把蛋壳弄进去了 哎呀
Oh, I got some shells in 'em! Uh-oh!

419
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:56,560
你要不要这么绝情啊
Are you serious?

420
00:19:02,654 --> 00:19:05,097
-嘿 -米奇尔
- Hey. - Hey, Mitchell.

421
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:06,960
那个 我知道你永远不会...
So, I know you'd never, um-

422
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:09,740
我知道你永远不会
I know you'd never,

423
00:19:09,740 --> 00:19:12,040
你看到我现在的样子永远也不会相信
never believe this by looking at me right now,

424
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:15,040
我以前在学校也被排斥被欺负
but, um, I used to get picked on at school too.

425
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:17,999
-杰告诉你了哈 -是啊
- So Jay told you? - Yeah.

426
00:19:17,999 --> 00:19:20,778
他们会说我是怪胎
Yeah, they would, um- they'd call me weird.

427
00:19:20,778 --> 00:19:23,186
我的确很怪 有趣的那种怪
I was weird. Uh, fun weird.

428
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:25,660
但是成长的可笑之处就在这里
But I- This is the funny thing about growing up.

429
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:28,260
在多年的时间中 大家都很害怕
For years and years, everybody's desperately afraid...

430
00:19:28,260 --> 00:19:29,640
标新立异 异于常人
to be different, you know, in any way.

431
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:33,840
然后 突然间 几乎是一夜之间
And then, suddenly, almost overnight,

432
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:36,440
大家又都想异于常人
everybody wants to be different,

433
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:40,080
那就是我们胜利的时候
and that is where we win.

434
00:19:40,212 --> 00:19:43,897
-我期盼着那一天的到来 -是啊
- I'm sort of counting on that. - Yeah.

435
00:19:44,030 --> 00:19:46,908
-我很抱歉对你太不客气了 -那...
- I'm sorry I was picking on you too much. -Ah, that's-

436
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:48,340
杰说兄弟间就是那样相处的
Jay said that's what brothers do.

437
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:51,520
我们可以不用听他的
Well, we don't have to listen to him.

438
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:53,640
-有时兄弟会合伙反抗老爸的 -姑娘们
- Brothers do that too. - Okay, ladies.

439
00:19:53,860 --> 00:19:54,840
茶话会该开完了吧
Finish up your tea party.

440
00:19:55,180 --> 00:19:56,040
你们要错过好戏了
You're missing the show.

441
00:19:56,092 --> 00:19:58,445
真不该相信我会和这家伙较劲儿 是吧
Can't believe I was fighting over this guy, huh?

442
00:19:58,540 --> 00:20:02,520
快看 快看
Check it out. Check it out.

443
00:20:03,100 --> 00:20:04,920
-哇 -太美了
- Wow. - Awesome!

444
00:20:09,349 --> 00:20:11,574
为什么梵高会创作《星夜》那幅画呢
Why did he paint The Starry Night?

445
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:14,970
或许是因为天空很美丽
Maybe because the sky is beautiful,

446
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:17,740
每个人都喜欢仰望星空
and everybody likes looking at it,

447
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:20,920
那提醒我们
and it reminds us

448
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:23,880
天空中有东西在时刻盯着我们
that something's up there watching over all of us-

449
00:20:24,533 --> 00:20:27,640
是外星人 他们可以瞬间到达地球
aliens, who could be here in a second...

450
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:30,140
把我们溶解成液体 变成燃料
to liquefy us and use us as fuel.

451
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:32,640
醒醒吧 全人类 下一个就是我们了
So wake up, people. We're next.

452
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:33,740
妈
Mom!

453
00:20:35,100 --> 00:20:36,880
你最好快下来
You better get down here!

454
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:43,080
哦 老天啊
Oh, my God.

455
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:45,520
哇 好美味哦
Wow! Delicious!

456
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:47,740
我真为你骄傲
I am so proud.

457
00:20:47,740 --> 00:20:49,629
谢了 妈 我把这些都包起来
Oh! Thanks, Mom. I'm just gonna wrap these up.

458
00:20:49,629 --> 00:20:50,483
不 那个 宝贝
No. You know what, sweetie?

459
00:20:50,483 --> 00:20:51,673
你上学要迟到了 快走吧
You're gonna be late for school. Just go.

460
00:20:51,739 --> 00:20:52,621
我一会儿给你送过去
I'll bring 'em by later.

461
00:20:52,621 --> 00:20:53,552
-真的吗 -是的
- Are you sure? -Yeah!

462
00:20:53,552 --> 00:20:55,633
-快去吧 甜品大师 -好的
- Get out of here, Betty Crocker. - Okay.

463
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:57,920
我真为你骄傲
I'm so proud of you!

464
00:20:59,780 --> 00:21:01,660
我们还有中毒控制中心的电话吗
Do we still have the number for Poison Control?

465
00:21:01,743 --> 00:21:04,260
我爱你 克莱尔 至"死"不渝
I love you, Claire. I'll always love you!

466
00:21:04,260 --> 00:21:06,340
我的嘴巴麻醉了 像看牙医的时候一样
My mouth is asleep, like at the dentist.

467
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:07,600
快过来 老弟
Get over here, buddy.
